1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:04,950
The fact that there is even a modicum of doubt

2
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:12,150
on whether or not the woman who shot Adjika Owens

3
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:15,050
should be criminally charged

4
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:20,070
is representative of the fact that racism continues

5
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:24,110
to plague so many systems in this country.

6
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:26,250
I don't want to hear y'all say,

7
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:27,790
well, why didn't she call the police?

8
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:30,090
I guess you've never been to Ocala.

9
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:35,150
So many of us do not look to the police for protection.

10
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:38,470
We also don't look to the police as allies

11
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,750
in our efforts for peacekeeping.

12
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:44,530
The sheriff is trying to paint Adjika as an aggressor

13
00:00:44,530 --> 00:00:48,010
for coming over and knocking on this woman's door

14
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:50,130
after this woman assaulted her children,

15
00:00:50,610 --> 00:00:53,230
called them racial slurs and cursed at them

16
00:00:53,230 --> 00:00:54,730
and stole their property.

17
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:57,990
This reminds us that this country continues to feel

18
00:00:57,990 --> 00:01:02,110
that Black people have no right to speak up for ourselves

19
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:04,050
and have no right to challenge

20
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:07,370
when we have been wronged by white people.

21
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:10,070
Adjika had every right to come over there

22
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:11,870
to discuss what had happened with her children

23
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:13,950
and she was murdered for it.

24
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:16,870
And the woman, her neighbor Susan Lawrence,

25
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:19,130
a 58-year-old white woman who lived in her complex,

26
00:01:19,490 --> 00:01:21,450
should be arrested immediately.

27
00:01:21,930 --> 00:01:23,830
She is a menace to society

28
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:26,530
and she took a mother away from four children

29
00:01:26,530 --> 00:01:29,470
who was clearly showing that she was there to protect them.

